{#- nexus_vlan.j2 - Cisco Nexus 9000 (NX-OS) VLAN database config.

  Rendered once per nexus9k device from that device's render_context (built
  in TODO 04, rendered in TODO 05). vlans here is render_context.vlans -
  the same list as inventory/devices.py's resolved_vlans, already filtered
  for this device's environment and site, already sorted. This template
  does no filtering itself; it only turns each VLAN entry into the matching
  vlan/name pair.

  Compare a rendered output against golden/<site_id>/<device_id>.cfg to
  confirm a render is correct - see golden/README.md.

  {%- and -%} on this comment's own delimiters (not the {% for %} below)
  keep this documentation out of the rendered output entirely - it should
  never change what a real device receives.
-#}
hostname {{ hostname }}
!
{% for vlan in vlans %}
vlan {{ vlan.id }}
  name {{ vlan.name }}
{% endfor %}
!
